  <item>
    <title>06 嘿！girls，让美丽成为我们最不值一提的优点。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6356b1a4e67030aadb38fdc3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6356b1a4e67030aadb38fdc3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Oct 2022 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从小到大女人们被要求要美，被苛责不够美。我们费尽心机维持美丽，居然又告诉我们要做到松弛，不露痕迹的美！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我和新朋友泡芙聊了“美女”这个标签，赞美也可能成为某种规训吗？活在框架里真的让我们内心更轻松吗？</span><strong><span>放弃“服美役”之后的生活，我只想大大叹一口气。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/ 你会听到 /</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 一个契机让我发现自己如此在意自己“够不够美丽”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 泡芙的身材焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1364">22:44</a> 有美貌是件绝对的好事吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">27:43</a> 自信且坚定就是美丽本身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a> 从穿衣服谈起 所谓缺点也是特别之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">45:01</a> 内在自我的定位和外在自我的需求并不冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a> “美”只是为了我开心？有可能吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3903">1:05:03</a> 生活需要多重价值感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4364">1:12:44</a> 不要假设自己永远是胜出的那个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4847">1:20:47</a> 因为不够美所以“我不配”？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/ Music /</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>那个女孩 - 卢广仲、陶喆</span></p><span></span><p><span>傲娇 - 张惠妹、徐佳莹、艾怡良</span></p><span></span><p><span>*封面来自：Mixkit</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>更多信息见主页节目详情</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
