  <item>
    <title>01 大四学姐的毕业复盘，如果时光倒流，我会如何度过我的大学生活？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629d79ff525536dd029363a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">629d79ff525536dd029363a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jun 2022 03:52:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我并不想试图阻止遗憾的发生，遗憾就是生命的一部分，如果时光倒流，我会填上此刻的遗憾，但我知道我也将会收获新的遗憾。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有正确答案，但你可以点进来，去听听看我的假设，我的另一种可能性。希望对你有所帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>/你会听到/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 遗憾是必需品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a>（Part 1）一些遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a> 先交朋友 而不是先谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">9:27</a> 去探索自己更多的可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 上课坐前排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 提前了解学校的各项制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 和大学所在的城市“亲密接触”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> （Part2）一些感恩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> 朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 进入“恋爱大学”的我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1508">25:08</a> 老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 学校</span></p><span></span><p><span>/音乐（按顺序）/</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵What Can I Say After I Say I'm Sorry (RVG Remaster)-Red Garland Trio</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Janet-ampoff</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵I'm Lost-George Shearing</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵I Do Adore-Mindy Gledhill</span></p><span></span><p><span>/我提到的播客/</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628e099e5cf4a5ad60ca0b36?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMWMwZGRkZTBmNWU3MjNiYjU1YWVkNyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/628e099e5cf4a5ad60ca0b36?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMWMwZGRkZTBmNWU3MjNiYjU1YWVkNyJ9"><span>vol.2 我们大学是怎么快乐赚钱的</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>/关于我/</span></p><span></span><p><span>仍然有旺盛的表达欲的一人，仍然对世界有敏锐触角的一人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有一档“正经播客”：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6274a5381202a916827bd215?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMWMwZGRkZTBmNWU3MjNiYjU1YWVkNyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6274a5381202a916827bd215?s=eyJ1IjogIjYwMWMwZGRkZTBmNWU3MjNiYjU1YWVkNyJ9"><span>《花里胡哨》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你的关注</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起探索吧🪐</span></p>]]></description>
